  {
   "id": "7ff167a",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "What Our Customers Say",
     "href": null,
     "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Montserrat\", Sans-serif;font-size:1.5vw;line-height:1.3em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:700;text-transform:capitalize",
     "eid": "6fbb11b"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "I'm so happy with the work done by Moe and the team. I found all of the communications to be very friendly, straightforward and timely. The process of the design was easy and the payment was reasonable as well! When I saw the decals and partial wrap for the first time it blew me away. The quality of the installation is very good too. Overall, I'm looking forward to doing more when I can. <span class=\"tm-name\">Scottify Productions</span><span>Google Review</span> These guys are amazing. We had two trucks wrapped here for a new venture and the service, price and quality of work all exceeded our expectations. We were pretty high maintenance and twice had last minute changes, Paulo and his team were patient, gracious and a real pleasure to deal with. Really felt like they appreciated and valued our business, a refreshing change. <span class=\"tm-name\">Clancy McNamara</span><span>Google Review</span> These guys are amazing.. They have done a full wrap on one of my cars and stripes on another. Second to none quality. DO NOT use the cheapest guys.. you'll pay for it twice, I did. QUALITY MATTERS. Thank you!!! <span class=\"tm-name\">Shaun M</span><span>Google Review</span> I would not trust my beautiful Lexus with just anyone! I had the entire vehicle wrapped and was amazed at the beautiful job this company did. Everyone cannot get over the quality of the wrap. You will not regret using a company of such integrity and outstanding work! We take all our company vehicles here, you should too! <span class=\"tm-name\">Karen Allen</span><span>Google Review</span> Outstanding service. They know best! They conviced me to go Black Satin vs Matte Black for my Tesla Model 3 and I'm happy with the choice. They aren't pushy and provide great feedback. Had some issues with peeling and they fixed it in under an hour. 10/10, will be a return customer <span class=\"tm-name\">Richard Andrews</span><span>Google Review</span> <i></i> <i></i>",
     "style": null,
     "eid": "183566e"
    }
   ],
